  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "h4_00001",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[A1][/A1]NAME",
    "placeholders": {
     "A1": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_338_01\" id=\"tag_17_338_01\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     13
    ],
    "text": "mkdir, mkdirat — make a directory",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_338_02\" id=\"tag_17_338_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_stat.h.html\">sys/stat.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nint mkdir(const char *</tt><i>path</i><tt>, mode_t</tt> <i>mode</i><tt>);<br>\n<br>\n<sup>[<a href=\"javascript:open_code('OH')\">OH</a>]</sup> <img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" border=\"0\">#include\n&lt;fcntl.h&gt;<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" border=\"0\"><br>\n<br>\nint mkdirat(int</tt> <i>fd</i><tt>, const char *</tt><i>path</i><tt>, mode_t</tt> <i>mode</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_338_03\" id=\"tag_17_338_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]mkdir[/I5]() function shall create a new directory with name [I6]path[/I6]. The file permission bits [S7][[A8]XSI[/A8]][/S7] [IMG9] &nbsp;and S_ISVTX\nbit [IMG10] &nbsp;of the new directory shall be initialized from\n[I11]mode[/I11]. The file permission bits of the [I12]mode[/I12] argument shall be modified by the file creation mask of the process.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "S7": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A8": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;XSI&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG9": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "IMG10": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "I11": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I12": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "When bits in [I13]mode[/I13] other than the file permission bits [S14][[A15]XSI[/A15]][/S14]\n[IMG16] &nbsp;and S_ISVTX [IMG17] &nbsp;are set, the meaning of these additional bits is implementation-defined.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I13": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "S14": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A15": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;XSI&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG16": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "IMG17": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\">"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00008",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The directory's user ID shall be set to the process' effective user ID. The directory's group ID shall be set to the group ID of\nthe parent directory or to the effective group ID of the process. Implementations shall provide a way to initialize the directory's\ngroup ID to the group ID of the parent directory. Implementations may, but need not, provide an implementation-defined way to\ninitialize the directory's group ID to the effective group ID of the calling process.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00009",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The newly created directory shall be an empty directory.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00010",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     9
    ],
    "text": "If [I18]path[/I18] names a symbolic link, [I19]mkdir[/I19]() shall fail and set [I20]errno[/I20] to [EEXIST].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I18": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I19": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I20": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00011",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     11
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, [I21]mkdir[/I21]() shall mark for update the last data access, last data modification, and last file\nstatus change timestamps of the directory. Also, the last data modification and last file status change timestamps of the directory\nthat contains the new entry shall be marked for update.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I21": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00012",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     13
    ],
    "text": "The [I22]mkdirat[/I22]() function shall be equivalent to the [I23]mkdir[/I23]() function except in the case where [I24]path[/I24] specifies\na relative path. In this case the newly created directory is created relative to the directory associated with the file descriptor\n[I25]fd[/I25] instead of the current working directory. If the access mode of the open file description associated with the file\ndescriptor is not O_SEARCH, the function shall check whether directory searches are permitted using the current permissions of the\ndirectory underlying the file descriptor. If the access mode is O_SEARCH, the function shall not perform the check.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I22": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I23": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I24": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I25": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00013",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     15
    ],
    "text": "If [I26]mkdirat[/I26]() is passed the special value AT_FDCWD in the [I27]fd[/I27] parameter, the current working directory shall be used\nand the behavior shall be identical to a call to [I28]mkdir[/I28]().",
    "placeholders": {
     "I26": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I27": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I28": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00014",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A29][/A29]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A29": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_338_04\" id=\"tag_17_338_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00015",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, these functions shall return 0. Otherwise, these functions shall return -1 and set [I30]errno[/I30] to\nindicate the error. If -1 is returned, no directory shall be created.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I30": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00016",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[A31][/A31]ERRORS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A31": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_338_05\" id=\"tag_17_338_05\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00017",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     1
    ],
    "text": "These functions shall fail if:",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00018",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EACCES]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00019",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     5
    ],
    "text": "Search permission is denied on a component of the path prefix, or write permission is denied on the parent directory of the\ndirectory to be created.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00020",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[EEXIST]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00021",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The named file exists.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00022",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[EILSEQ]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00023",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     13
    ],
    "text": "The last pathname component of [I32]path[/I32] is not a portable filename, and cannot be created in the target directory.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I32": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00024",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[ELOOP]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00025",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     17
    ],
    "text": "A loop exists in symbolic links encountered during resolution of the [I33]path[/I33] argument.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I33": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00026",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[EMLINK]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00027",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     21
    ],
    "text": "The link count of the parent directory would exceed {LINK_MAX}.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00028",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[ENAMETOOLONG]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00029",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     25
    ],
    "text": "The length of a component of a pathname is longer than {NAME_MAX}.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00030",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[ENOENT]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00031",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     29
    ],
    "text": "A component of the path prefix of [I34]path[/I34] does not name an existing file or [I35]path[/I35] is an empty string.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I34": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I35": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00032",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     31
    ],
    "text": "[ENOSPC]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00033",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     33
    ],
    "text": "The file system does not contain enough space to hold the contents of the new directory or to extend the parent directory of\nthe new directory.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00034",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     35
    ],
    "text": "[ENOTDIR]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00035",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     37
    ],
    "text": "A component of the path prefix names an existing file that is neither a directory nor a symbolic link to a directory.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00036",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     39
    ],
    "text": "[EROFS]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00037",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     41
    ],
    "text": "The parent directory resides on a read-only file system.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00038",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     5
    ],
    "text": "In addition, the [I36]mkdirat[/I36]() function shall fail if:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I36": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00039",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     7,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EACCES]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00040",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     7,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The access mode of the open file description associated with [I37]fd[/I37] is not O_SEARCH and the permissions of the directory\nunderlying [I38]fd[/I38] do not permit directory searches.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I37": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I38": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00041",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     7,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[EBADF]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00042",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     7,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The [I39]path[/I39] argument does not specify an absolute path and the [I40]fd[/I40] argument is neither AT_FDCWD nor a valid file\ndescriptor open for reading or searching.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I39": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I40": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00043",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     7,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[ENOTDIR]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00044",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     7,
     13
    ],
    "text": "The [I41]path[/I41] argument is not an absolute path and [I42]fd[/I42] is a file descriptor associated with a non-directory file.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I41": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I42": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00045",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     9
    ],
    "text": "These functions may fail if:",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00046",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     11,
     3
    ],
