   {
    "id": "h4_00066",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     55
    ],
    "text": "[A74][/A74]CHANGE HISTORY",
    "placeholders": {
     "A74": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_338_11\" id=\"tag_17_338_11\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00067",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     57,
     1
    ],
    "text": "First released in Issue 3. Included for alignment with the POSIX.1-1988 standard.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00068",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     59
    ],
    "text": "[A75][/A75]Issue 6",
    "placeholders": {
     "A75": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_338_12\" id=\"tag_17_338_12\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00069",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     1
    ],
    "text": "In the SYNOPSIS, the optional include of the [A76][I77]&lt;sys/types.h&gt;[/I77][/A76] header is\nremoved.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A76": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_types.h.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I77": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00070",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The following new requirements on POSIX implementations derive from alignment with the Single UNIX Specification:",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00071",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     5,
     1,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The requirement to include [A78][I79]&lt;sys/types.h&gt;[/I79][/A78] has been removed. Although\n[A80][I81]&lt;sys/types.h&gt;[/I81][/A80] was required for conforming implementations of previous POSIX\nspecifications, it was not required for UNIX applications.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A78": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_types.h.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I79": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A80": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_types.h.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I81": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00072",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     5,
     3,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [ELOOP] mandatory error condition is added.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00073",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     5,
     5,
     1
    ],
    "text": "A second [ENAMETOOLONG] is added as an optional error condition.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00074",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The following changes were made to align with the IEEE&nbsp;P1003.1a draft standard:",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00075",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     9,
     1,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [ELOOP] optional error condition is added.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00076",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     63
    ],
    "text": "[A82][/A82]Issue 7",
    "placeholders": {
     "A82": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_338_13\" id=\"tag_17_338_13\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00077",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Austin Group Interpretation 1003.1-2001 #143 is applied.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00078",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I83]mkdirat[/I83]() function is added from The Open Group Technical Standard, 2006, Extended API Set Part 2.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I83": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00079",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     5
    ],
    "text": "Changes are made related to support for finegrained timestamps.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00080",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     7
    ],
    "text": "POSIX.1-2008, Technical Corrigendum 1, XSH/TC1-2008/0375 [461], XSH/TC1-2008/0376 [324], XSH/TC1-2008/0377 [277],\nXSH/TC1-2008/0378 [278], and XSH/TC1-2008/0379 [278] are applied.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00081",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     9
    ],
    "text": "POSIX.1-2008, Technical Corrigendum 2, XSH/TC2-2008/0210 [873], XSH/TC2-2008/0211 [591], XSH/TC2-2008/0212 [817],\nXSH/TC2-2008/0213 [817], and XSH/TC2-2008/0214 [591] are applied.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00082",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     67
    ],
    "text": "[A84][/A84]Issue 8",
    "placeholders": {
     "A84": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_338_14\" id=\"tag_17_338_14\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00083",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Austin Group Defect 251 is applied, encouraging implementations to disallow the creation of filenames containing any bytes that\nhave the encoded value of a &lt;newline&gt; character.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00084",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     3
    ],
    "text": "Austin Group Defects 293 and 1734 are applied, adding the [EILSEQ] error.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00085",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     5
    ],
    "text": "Austin Group Defect 1522 is applied, adding requirements relating to the S_ISVTX bit.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00086",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     7
    ],
    "text": "Austin Group Defect 1729 is applied, changing the description of the [ENOENT] error.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00087",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     75
    ],
    "text": "&nbsp;",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   }
  ]
 }
